<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission confirms revaluation of green punt.</title>
<headline>EU Commission confirms revaluation of green punt.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Friday confirmed the revaluation of the Irish green punt to 0.812908 per Ecu in the agrimonetary exchange system from a previous rate of 0.829498.</p>
<p>The revaluation came ahead of schedule after a request from the Irish delegation to Thursday's European Union cereals management committee in order to limit the impact of revaluation on Irish farmers, who faced a higher rise on Monday.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
